                <pb facs="0607" n="491" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg491"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/11732.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Canada to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Vera Cruz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-04-27T14:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 27, 1914, 2 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The American flag was raised over the port of Vera Cruz with impressive ceremony
                    at two p.m.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Canada</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
